## Tool used 
Manual Review


## Recommendation

Add require statements such as:

     require(_owner != address(0), "SystemConfig: owner is the zero address");
     require(_unsafeBlockSigner != address(0), "SystemConfig: _unsafeBlockSigner is the zero address");

